  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "材料力學",
    "sub_ename": "MECHANICS OF MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "利用基本力學原理，學習土木工程常用材料應力應變行為，及其分析方式，並引入常用元件分析，例如二力桿件、薄?、樑、柱，加強學習土木工程常用之力學分析方法。",
    "describe_eh": "Based on the fundamental mechanics, the class teaches students to learn the strain-stress behavior and relationships, and its analysis. The common structural elements in civil engineering, like rods, shell, beams, and columns, are introduced in terms of analysis of mechanics. The class aims to enhance student’s capability of performing analysis of mechanics of materials in civil engineering.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
